{
  "info": {
    "name": "b2c-admin",
    "description": "Manual testing collection for the B2C platform API.\n\nRun order:\n1. admin — setup: Staff login → GTS credentials create → activate (once per environment); Demo — switch on (works end to end); Payme — settings + switch on (optional — GTS's test server prices everything at 0.00, and the Payme adapter refuses a zero amount, so a real charge never completes here; it is included to show the panel and site-config with more than one method enabled). health should say gts: ok\n2. auth — customer: Login (or Register + confirm)\n3. flight: Search → Offers (repeat until search_status is \"success\") → Verify → Booking\n4. orders: list and detail\n\nTokens, request_id, offer_id, order_id and payment_id are captured into collection variables automatically. Every response uses the {status, data, errors, meta} envelope; errors carry GTS's own message in meta.upstream.\n\nPay — step 1 sends {{payment_method}} (default demo — the only method that actually pays here); switch it to payme to exercise the panel/site-config path instead, keeping in mind it cannot complete a charge.\n\nWARNING: Booking against a live GTS account creates a real hold at the supplier.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "admin — setup",
      "description": "One-time setup: sign in as staff, store the GTS agent account and activate it. `health` should then report `gts: ok`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Staff login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/auth/login/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "auth",
                "login",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Owner/admin sign-in. Saves {{admin_access_token}}.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"login\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.status === \"success\" && body.data && body.data.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"admin_access_token\", body.data.access_token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"admin_refresh_token\", body.data.refresh_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GTS credentials — list",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/integrations/gts/credentials/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "integrations",
                "gts",
                "credentials",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Stored GTS accounts, passwords masked.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GTS credentials — create",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/integrations/gts/credentials/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "integrations",
                "gts",
                "credentials",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Store the GTS agent account. Saves {{credential_id}}.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"label\": \"Main agent\",\n    \"email\": \"agent@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"gts-password\",\n    \"base_url\": \"https://api2.globaltravel.space\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.data && body.data.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"credential_id\", body.data.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GTS credentials — activate",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/integrations/gts/credentials/{{credential_id}}/activate/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "integrations",
                "gts",
                "credentials",
                "{{credential_id}}",
                "activate",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Use this account for every GTS call from now on (owner only).",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Payment providers — list (fields, masked secrets)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/integrations/payments/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "integrations",
                "payments",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Every provider the release knows, with the settings form its adapter declares (`fields`). Secret values come back masked; `environment` and the rest are shown as written.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload — payment logo",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/uploads/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "uploads",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "multipart/form-data. purpose=payment_logo — PNG/JPEG/WEBP/GIF/SVG, max 1 MB. Pick a file in the `file` row below (Postman leaves it empty in a shared collection; select one on your machine before sending). Saves {{upload_id}}; attach it with Payme — attach logo (or any other provider's logo_id the same way).",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": []
                },
                {
                  "key": "purpose",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "payment_logo"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body.data && body.data.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('upload_id', body.data.id);",
                  "  console.log('upload', body.data.id, body.data.url);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Payme — attach logo",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/integrations/payments/payme/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "integrations",
                "payments",
                "payme",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Points the row at the file Upload — payment logo just created (replaces whatever logo it held before, if any). The response's logo_url is what site-config's payment_methods will show next to the Payme button.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"logo_id\": \"{{upload_id}}\"\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Payme — settings",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/integrations/payments/payme/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "integrations",
                "payments",
                "payme",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Owner only. Keys merge; send null to delete one. `environment`: test | production. Fiscal keys are optional and go out as receipts.create → detail only when filled. Switching on needs merchant_id and key — press the test button first.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"credentials\": {\n    \"merchant_id\": \"<kassa id>\",\n    \"key\": \"<kassa kaliti>\",\n    \"environment\": \"test\",\n    \"account_field\": \"order_id\"\n  },\n  \"enabled\": false\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Payme — test the stored settings (moves no money)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/integrations/payments/payme/test/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "integrations",
                "payments",
                "payme",
                "test",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Owner only. receipts.get_all against the stored merchant_id:key. 200 with ok: false and Payme's words when refused; writes last_tested_at / last_test_ok / last_test_error.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Payme — switch on",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/integrations/payments/payme/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "integrations",
                "payments",
                "payme",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Needs merchant_id and key already stored (Payme — settings). Several providers may be enabled at once — this does not switch any other off.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"enabled\": true\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Demo — switch on",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/integrations/payments/demo/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "integrations",
                "payments",
                "demo",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Charges nobody; the one code that pays is the panel's own otp (default 123456, shown here explicitly) — not DEBUG-gated, and the method Pay — step 1/2 exercise end to end by default.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"credentials\": {\n    \"otp\": \"123456\"\n  },\n  \"enabled\": true\n}"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "System health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/admin/system/health/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "admin",
                "system",
                "health",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Expect `gts: ok` once a credential is active.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{admin_access_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "auth — customer",
      "description": "Register once (the code is emailed; without SMTP in dev, read it from the `email_otps` table), or just log in. Tokens are saved automatically.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/public/auth/register/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "public",
                "auth",
                "register",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "204. Sends the confirmation code to the address.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"{{customer_email}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{customer_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Register — confirm",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/public/auth/register/confirm/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "public",
                "auth",
                "register",
                "confirm",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Exchange the emailed code for tokens. Saves {{access_token}}.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"{{customer_email}}\",\n    \"code\": \"123456\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.status === \"success\" && body.data && body.data.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token\", body.data.access_token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refresh_token\", body.data.refresh_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/public/auth/login/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "public",
                "auth",
                "login",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Sign in. Saves {{access_token}} and {{refresh_token}}.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"login\": \"{{customer_email}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{customer_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.status === \"success\" && body.data && body.data.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token\", body.data.access_token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refresh_token\", body.data.refresh_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/public/auth/refresh/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "public",
                "auth",
                "refresh",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rotate the refresh token for a new pair.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"refresh_token\": \"{{refresh_token}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.status === \"success\" && body.data && body.data.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"access_token\", body.data.access_token);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refresh_token\", body.data.refresh_token);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "flight",
      "description": "search → offers (poll until search_status is \"success\") → verify → booking. The search steps need no token; booking needs the customer token. WARNING: booking against a live GTS creates a real hold.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Search",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/public/flight/search/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "public",
                "flight",
                "search",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Start a search. Saves {{request_id}}.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"directions\": [\n        {\n            \"departure\": \"TAS\",\n            \"arrival\": \"IST\",\n            \"departure_date\": \"2026-10-01\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"adt\": 1,\n    \"chd\": 0,\n    \"inf\": 0,\n    \"ins\": 0,\n    \"class\": \"E\",\n    \"direct\": false\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (body && body.data && body.data.request_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"request_id\", body.data.request_id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Offers",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/public/flight/offers/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "public",
                "flight",
                "offers",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "One page of offers. Poll until search_status is \"success\". Saves the first offer's id into {{offer_id}} — change it by hand to book a different one.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"request_id\": \"{{request_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "var data = body && body.data;",
                  "console.log(\"search_status:\", data && data.search_status);",
                  "if (data && Array.isArray(data.offers) && data.offers.length > 0",
                  "        && data.offers[0].offer_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"offer_id\", data.offers[0].offer_id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Upsell",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/public/flight/upsell/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "public",
                "flight",
                "upsell",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Branded fares of the chosen offer. Each variant carries a NEW offer_id — copy it into {{offer_id}} yourself if you pick one (not saved automatically).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"request_id\": \"{{request_id}}\",\n    \"offer_id\": \"{{offer_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/public/flight/verify/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "public",
                "flight",
                "verify",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Re-check price and availability right before booking.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"request_id\": \"{{request_id}}\",\n    \"offer_id\": \"{{offer_id}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Booking",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/public/flight/booking/",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "public",
                "flight",
                "booking",
                ""
              ]
            },
            "description": "Book the verified offer. 201 answers {order, payment, order_data}. Saves our order id into {{order_id}}.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"request_id\": \"{{request_id}}\",\n    \"offer_id\": \"{{offer_id}}\",\n    \"passengers\": [\n        {\n            \"type\": \"ADT\",\n            \"gender\": \"M\",\n            \"first_name\": \"Azimjon\",\n            \"last_name\": \"Yusufov\",\n            \"middle_name\": \"Kamoliddin\",\n            \"birth_date\": \"2002-12-20\",\n            \"citizenship\": \"UZ\",\n            \"document\": {\n                \"type\": \"PSP\",\n                \"number\": \"FA2145157\",\n                \"issue_date\": \"2019-05-30\",\n                \"expire_date\": \"2029-05-29\"\n            },\n            \"email\": \"{{customer_email}}\",\n            \"phone\": {\n                \"phone_code\": \"998\",\n                \"phone_number\": \"901234567\"\n            }\n        }\n    ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
